<Information title="About" description="Kogen is Almir Sarajčić’s software-building project, under active development.">
<p class="lead">Shape the feature. Leave the build to Kogen.</p>
<p>Kogen is <a href="https://almirsarajcic.com">Almir Sarajčić’s</a> software-building project. Make the product and UX decisions that define the feature. Specify technical decisions when they matter. Kogen handles the implementation, checking, independent review, rework, and resulting commit.</p>
<p>Kogen is under active development and is not yet intended for general use. The <a href="https://github.com/KogenAI/kogen">source is available for inspection</a>.</p>
<p>Read the <a href="/origins/">origins</a> for how Kogen began, or the <a href="/notes/">notes</a> for practical findings from building it.</p>
</Information>
